 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF6-CUBE-TICK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE L-I(1) TO L-O(1)
     COMPUTE L-O(2) = L-I(1) + (L-I(2) - L-I(1)) * 0.5
     MOVE L-I(2) TO L-O(3)
     MOVE 0 TO L-O(5) L-O(6)
     IF L-I(3) NOT = 0 AND L-I(4) = 0
         MOVE -0.5 TO L-O(3)
         MOVE 1 TO L-O(5)
     END-IF
     IF L-I(3) = 0 AND L-I(4) NOT = 0
         MOVE 1 TO L-O(3)
         MOVE 1 TO L-O(6)
     END-IF
     MOVE L-I(3) TO L-O(4)
     IF L-I(5) NOT = 0
         COMPUTE L-O(3) = L-O(3) * 0.9
     ELSE
         COMPUTE L-O(3) = L-O(3) * 0.6
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF6-CUBE-TICK.

