 PROGRAM-ID. EF6-SULFUR-INNER.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE 0 TO L-O(1)
     IF L-I(1) = 0
         IF L-I(2) NOT = 0
             MOVE 1 TO L-O(1)
             MOVE 2 TO L-O(2)
             MOVE 6 TO L-O(3)
             MOVE 180 TO L-O(4)
             MOVE 0 TO L-O(5) L-O(6)
             MOVE 7 TO WS-K
             IF L-I(3) NOT = 0
                 MOVE 3 TO L-O(2)
                 MOVE 2 TO L-O(7)
                 MOVE 0.5 TO L-O(8) L-O(9) L-O(10)
                 MOVE 11 TO WS-K
             END-IF
             MOVE 1 TO L-O(WS-K)
             MOVE -0.5 TO L-O(WS-K + 1) L-O(WS-K + 3)
             MOVE -0.518 TO L-O(WS-K + 2)
         ELSE
             IF L-I(4) = 0
                 MOVE 2 TO L-O(1)
             END-IF
         END-IF
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF6-SULFUR-INNER.

